## Hardening Update - Duplicate Occurrence Race

Timestamp: 2026-08-29T05:36:57Z

Root issue: the scheduler prepared Run graph side effects before checking the `ScheduleOccurrenceRepository.create(...)` result. If occurrence creation reported a dedupe duplicate at that boundary, the scheduler could proceed as if it enqueued a fresh occurrence.

